			"color":"#432",
			"widgets_values":[
				"【Qwen Image 3.0 文生图 · AI 海报级高清大图】\n\n通\n义\n千\n问\n最\n新\n一\n代\n图\n像\n生\n成\n模\n型\n，\n理\n解\n力\n强\n、\n文\n字\n渲\n染\n准\n、\n画\n质\n细\n腻\n。\n一\n句\n话\n出\n海\n报\n级\n大\n图\n。\n\n\n\n\n【\n怎\n么\n用\n】\n\n\n1\n.\n「\n画\n面\n描\n述\n」\n写\n清\n你\n要\n的\n画\n面\n（\n中\n英\n文\n都\n行\n，\n越\n具\n体\n越\n好\n）\n。\n\n\n2\n.\n「\n画\n幅\n尺\n寸\n」\n选\n档\n，\n1\n5\n \n种\n可\n选\n：\n\n\n \n \n \n·\n \n方\n图\n \n1\n0\n2\n4\n×\n1\n0\n2\n4\n \n·\n \n竖\n版\n \n7\n6\n8\n×\n1\n1\n5\n2\n \n/\n \n1\n0\n2\n4\n×\n1\n5\n3\n6\n \n·\n \n横\n版\n \n1\n1\n5\n2\n×\n7\n6\n8\n \n/\n \n1\n9\n2\n0\n×\n1\n2\n8\n0\n\n\n \n \n \n·\n \n高\n清\n \n1\n5\n3\n6\n×\n2\n0\n4\n8\n \n·\n \n2\n0\n4\n8\n×\n1\n1\n5\n2\n \n·\n \n1\n6\n0\n0\n×\n1\n6\n0\n0\n\n\n3\n.\n「\n生\n成\n张\n数\n」\n1\n-\n6\n \n张\n。\n\n\n4\n.\n「\n提\n示\n词\n智\n能\n扩\n写\n」\n建\n议\n开\n启\n \n—\n—\n \nA\nI\n \n自\n动\n把\n短\n句\n补\n成\n专\n业\n提\n示\n词\n。\n\n\n5\n.\n「\n深\n度\n思\n考\n」\n开\n启\n后\n理\n解\n复\n杂\n长\n句\n更\n准\n（\n略\n慢\n）\n。\n\n\n6\n.\n \n点\n击\n运\n行\n，\n约\n \n2\n0\n-\n6\n0\n \n秒\n出\n图\n。\n\n\n\n\n【\n适\n合\n什\n么\n场\n景\n】\n\n\n电\n商\n海\n报\n \n·\n \n产\n品\n主\n图\n \n·\n \n公\n众\n号\n配\n图\n \n·\n \n小\n说\n插\n图\n \n·\n \n社\n媒\n素\n材"
			],
